WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.086
[MUSIC]

00:00:01.086 --> 00:00:03.927
I've worked at the same company for
my entire career,

00:00:03.927 --> 00:00:05.960
which is completely unheard of.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.960
It's been a fantastic learning
ground here at micron for me.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.061
Over the years my career
progressed about six years ago,

00:00:15.061 --> 00:00:18.050
I was asked to take on the head job for
HR and

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.339
then this last year I was
promoted to chief people officer.

00:00:22.339 --> 00:00:23.943
One of my sources of inspiration or

00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:26.609
at least thought leadership
are my professors from ACP.

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:31.669
But now I need to go and give back and
make sure I create the space and

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:36.269
the opportunity for
others to have that same experience and

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:40.810
invest in themselves and
learn and develop and grow.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:46.140
So my team and I are working diligently on
making sure we're finding innovative ways.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.792
To actually keep our
communities educated and

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:53.484
really democratize a lot of the learnings
that we offer inside of the company, and

00:00:53.484 --> 00:00:56.800
make them available to
community members as well.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.699
That's a tremendous opportunity for
us to take our digital skills curriculum,

00:01:01.699 --> 00:01:04.440
and just make it available to anyone.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.444
Who wants to take our curriculum.

00:01:06.444 --> 00:01:11.610
That will not only certainly
help them prepare for

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:17.637
a career at micron, but
frankly will help them prepare for

00:01:17.637 --> 00:01:23.061
any other career or
help them to see succeed in life.

00:01:23.061 --> 00:01:30.534
[MUSIC]

